    "description": {
      "value": "\n<h2>Claire's Might</h2>\n<p>A latent combat state unique to Claire that pushes the Charge Blade beyond its normal operating limits.</p>\n<h3>Surges</h3><p>Claire has <strong>3 Surges per combat</strong>. Foundry resets them automatically when Claire enters a new Combat Tracker encounter.</p>\n<h3>Claire's Stance</h3><p>As a bonus action, spend 1 Surge. The activation turn is Stance Turn 1; the stance remains through Turns 2 and 3, then ends at the end of Turn 3. On activation, Charge becomes at least 3.</p>\n<h3>Ratchet Engine</h3><p>Ratchet is an engine, not a one-time charge. After activation, at the start of each later Claire turn while the stance lasts it advances Charge: below Yellow becomes at least 3; Yellow/4 becomes 5. At 5 it idles. If Charge is loaded and reset to 0, Ratchet begins building again. Ratchet never loads Phials itself.</p>\n<h3>Boosted Actions</h3><p>While in Claire's Stance, the activities on this feature unlock according to Charge Blade mode and resources. This feature augments the existing <strong>Charge Blade</strong> item; it does not replace it.</p>\n",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Claire's Might</strong> — 3 Surges per combat; unlocks Claire's Stance and boosted Charge Blade techniques.</p>"
    },
